# UI kit

Prefer `@nivra/ui` over new inputs/tables/charts.

- Display money with `formatINR` / `formatINRCurrency` (full `en-IN`).
- `formatCompactINR` only for axis ticks, not result values.
- `CalculatorPage` slots: title, `ClientHeader`, `ModeTabs`, form, results, disclaimer.
- Goal SIP Planner (`goal-sip-planner.tsx`) is a one-off. Other products must not clone its custom cards/themes.
- Keep layouts usable on mobile, tablet, and desktop (`min-h-dvh`, wrap grids, no clipped pie/bar charts).
